    Add SCHED_EXT from Linux 6.12 to bits/sched.h
    
    Linux 6.12 adds the SCHED_EXT constant.  Add it to glibc's
    bits/sched.h and update the kernel version in tst-sched-consts.py.
    
    Tested for x86_64.

